===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈstɹaɪ.dənt/|[ˈstɹaɪdˀnt]}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-strident.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[loud|Loud]]; [[shrill]], [[piercing]], high-[[pitch]]ed; [[rough]]-sounding
#: {{ux|en|The trumpet sounded '''strident''' against the string orchestra.}}
