# {{lb|en|nonstandard}} [[vigorous|Vigorous]]; making [[stride]]s
#* {{quote-journal|1=en|2=2003|3=November 6|4=Stuart Cosgrove|5=Taylor slagging Saddam shame.|6=Daily Record|city=Glasgow|url=http://www.highbeam.com/doc/1G1-109818227.html|passage=Under David Taylor's stewardship, the SFA has made '''strident''' progress.|title=Archived copy|accessdate=9 March 2009|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20121112170530/http://www.highbeam.com/doc/1G1-109818227.html|archivedate=12 November 2012}}

